{"id":"wb-6-509","name":"惠山镇祠堂","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"惠山镇祠堂","text":"惠山镇祠堂，又称惠山古镇、“惠山老街”。位于江苏省无锡市梁溪区惠山东北麓，与天下第二泉、寄畅园、惠山寺等诸多无锡著名人文景区相接，是一处以大片古祠堂群组成的历史遗迹，其由唐代为纪念春申君所设的大王庙发展至民国，形成了118座供祭各家姓氏先祖的古祠堂。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%83%A0%E5%B1%B1%E9%95%87%E7%A5%A0%E5%A0%82","revisionId":93744104,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93744104","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/22a70686339237df38c739f3.jpg","title":"Librairie_avant-garde_in_Wuxi_Huishan_2.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Librairie_avant-garde_in_Wuxi_Huishan_2.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/Librairie_avant-garde_in_Wuxi_Huishan_2.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"zcfofdu","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​先鋒書店無錫店","width":320,"height":482}}